{%- comment -%}
  Icons for the Felice team section (fills/strokes set to currentColor).
  Usage: {% render 'fa-icons-team', icon: 'instagram' %}
  The card arrow (Figma "chevron_backward", 414:789) is the shared chevron in fa-icon.
  - 'instagram' / 'facebook': the team cards' own glyphs (Figma 414:791 / 414:793, 16.86px boxes). They differ
    from the shared fa-icon instagram/facebook used in the header, so they live here.
  - 'x': Figma draws the team X as a 28px raster mask (414:795, 13.7px box, a thin outline X — not the filled
    X logo in fa-icon). This is a vector trace of that mask on a 28-unit grid.
  - 'instagram-large': the V5 booking cards' Instagram (Figma 2612:9870): the same glyph drawn 14px wide (instead of
    13.2) in the 16.86px box, 1.6 / 1.0 from its corner — the 'instagram' path with a tighter viewBox.
  - 'tiktok': the footer's TikTok glyph. 'blog': a page-with-lines article icon (no Figma drawing yet).
  - 'substack': Figma V5 draws it as a raster mask (2612:9877, 11.4 x 13.1 box); this is the standard Substack mark
    (two bars over a ribbon) on its own 21.08 x 24 grid.
{%- endcomment -%}
